# CAD / mesh / binary — never diff or merge these as text
*.step   binary
*.stp    binary
*.stl    binary
*.glb    binary
*.f3d    binary
*.dxf    binary
*.pdf    binary
*.png    binary

# If meshes get large, migrate to Git LFS:
#   git lfs install && git lfs track "*.glb" "*.stl" "*.step"

# An ingested document's bytes ARE its identity (ADR-0035 D5): ci/check_claims.py
# hashes each claims/<hex>/document.txt and requires the digest to equal its
# directory name. Line-ending conversion would rewrite those bytes on checkout
# and break the check on any machine with core.autocrlf=true, so never convert
# them -- the stored LF form is the hashed form.
claims/**/document.txt -text
